        "original_id": "fa339bd8-4be6-5c89-9d24-29829a065691",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sasson Gabai, Eran Kolirin\n- Works: The Band's Visit\n- Awards: Ophir Award, Asia Pacific Screen Award, European Film Awards, Jerusalem Film Festival\n- Topics: Israeli film, acting\n\nFacts:\n- Sasson Gabai was born on 24 November 1947 and is an Israeli actor.\n- The Band's Visit is a 2007 Israeli film directed by Eran Kolirin.\n- In 2007, Sasson Gabai won Best Actor honors for The Band's Visit at the Ophir Award, the European Film Awards, and the Jerusalem Film Festival.\n- In 2007, Sasson Gabai was nominated for an Asia Pacific Screen Award for Best Actor for The Band's Visit.",
